{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 22, :comments ["<b>The voice is the voice of Jacob.</b> Do not rely on the voice, for sometimes it changes on account of shouting — sometimes one calls out thick and sometimes clear. But rely on the fact that his hands were like the hands of Esau his brother, hairy, for he thinks this is a certain thing, and this matter brought him blessing."], :book :genesis, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 27, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:06:15.649474084Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}